# Frontend

Read and follow `frontend/restaurant-frontend-app/CLAUDE.md`.

- Standalone components, `inject()`, relative imports, `npm ci`
- Separate current conventions from unfinished migrations (signals, OnPush, zoneless)
- API disagreements: backend `docs/ApiRoutes.md` and `RouteRegistry.cs` win
- Do not commit `environment.production.ts`
